cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "ATRIUM digital-convert: conversion of born-digital PDF and office documents into ATRIUM document records with per-page text-layer assessment"
abstract: >-
  digital-convert reads a born-digital document, one made on a computer, such as a PDF or an office
  file. It writes the text as an ATRIUM document record: pages, lines in reading order, headings,
  tables and, for a PDF, exact positions. Later ATRIUM stages add their results to the same record.
  Use it when the text is already in the file. A scan belongs to the OCR route. It needs no OCR, no
  model and no network.
keywords:
  - "born-digital documents"
  - "document conversion"
  - "PDF text extraction"
  - "text-layer assessment"
  - "digital archives"
